173
00:12:26,847 --> 00:12:29,598
What do I need to remember?

174
00:12:30,133 --> 00:12:36,043
A rebase pauses on conflicts and edit stops; git rebase --continue resumes.

175
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,866
At an edit stop:

176
00:12:37,866 --> 00:12:41,980
--amend changes the commit, a plain commit adds one.

177
00:12:42,533 --> 00:12:46,888
Fix a slip with another interactive rebase (fixup).
